                <note rend="inline" type="source">417.00/338: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chargé in Nicaragua</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Hanna</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Managua</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1929-07-24T15:00:00-05:45">July 24, 1929—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 4:33 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>201. My 188, July 12, 3 p.m. second paragraph. Conservative Party selected five
                    candidates yesterday and the President told me this morning that he will appoint
                    one of these [as] Conservative member of the Claims Commission.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Hanna</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
